flowchart TD
    OP[Authorized responder] --> START[Start SSM Automation]
    START --> PRE[Preflight managed-node status]
    PRE -->|Not managed / offline / wrong OS| STOP[Abort safely]
    PRE -->|Online + supported OS| CMD[Run read-only collection command]
    CMD --> OUT[SSM Agent uploads stdout/stderr to S3]
    OUT --> ENC[S3 default SSE-KMS encryption]
    ENC --> HASH[Automation finalizer reads objects and computes SHA-256]
    HASH --> MAN[Write integrity-manifest.json]
    MAN --> REV[Responder retrieves and verifies evidence]
    REV --> IR[Link execution + manifest to incident record]
